WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.801
-Russian president
Vladimir Putin rattled the world

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:06.567
by raising the alert status
of Russia's nuclear forces

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:08.133
as Republicans here at home
gathered

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.267
for the Conservative
Political Action Conference,

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.100
who refused to condemn
Donald Trump

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.400
for praising Putin's "genius."

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.767
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:23.601
It really feels like everywhere
you look these days,

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:26.033
the world is at the whims
of fully insane people.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.334
Like, on top of everything else
that's going on right now,

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.267
I'm so mad that I have to care

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.834
what Marjorie Taylor Greene,
of all people, says and does.

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.200
This is a person who, at best,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.968
should have her picture
on the door of a Ruby Tuesday

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.400
below the words "do not admit"

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.501
because she tried to steal feta
from the salad bar.

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:44.100
And yet, depressingly,
I have to care

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.968
because a large portion
of the Republican Party

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:47.834
is defending
or even celebrating her,

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:50.334
despite, just as one
of many recent examples,

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.701
her participation in
a white nationalist conference.

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:54.300
In fact, this weekend, she also

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.901
did a truly
head-spinning interview

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.200
where she defended her attempt

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.667
to help Trump overturn
the election on January 6th

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.801
and doubled down on the big lie
that the election was stolen,

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.868
while essentially admitting
she had no proof.

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.234
-I proudly objected
on January 6th.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.100
I would object again today
because I know for a fact

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.868
there was so much wrong
in that election

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:14.400
and I believe it was stolen.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.868
Do I know how?
No, I don't know how.

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.801
-No, you don't.

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:22.634
Well, don't let that stop you.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.701
If you were at the zoo and one
of the attendants was like,

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:26.934
"Alright, kids, I'm going to
feed this poisonous cobra,

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:30.767
but fair warning --
I don't know how,"

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:33.200
you'd go to the aquarium, right?

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.067
I would also love for Greene
to stay out of the news,

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:37.234
because every time I see
her initials in an e-mail,

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:40.567
I think I have a meeting,
and I hate meetings,

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:43.067
especially our annual meeting
with the 30 Rock fire marshal.

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:45.968
Let me guess, in case of a fire,
we still take the stairs?

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:49.033
Because no one will listen
to my 30 Rock fire pole idea,

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:51.334
even though tourists
would love that.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:52.701
What's that?

00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:54.868
You want me to leave the meeting
because I'm a distraction?

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:57.033
Well, joke's on you because
I never wanted to be here

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.667
in the first place.

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:01.901
Where was I?
Oh, right, she's crazy.

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:04.968
Greene was at CPAC
mingling with the leading lights

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:07.634
and weirdest weirdos
of the modern GOP, like Trump,

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:09.367
Ron DeSantis, Ronny Jackson,

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:10.667
the former White House doctor

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.667
who said Trump had the brain
of Albert Einstein

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:15.067
and height and build
of a college linebacker,

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.767
and, of course,
the MyPillow guy, Mike Lindell,

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:20.801
who has a habit of popping up
at these conservative events

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:23.934
like Mickey Mouse at the Grand
Floridian breakfast buffet,

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:26.868
which is fitting since
Lindell's actual head

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.801
is the size of a mascot head.

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:30.968
One day, he's going to
pull it off

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:32.868
to reveal an underpaid
high school student.

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:37.601
"Hey, I never believed
in any of that stuff."

00:02:37.601 --> 00:02:40.067
You might remember that Lindell
was famously photographed

00:02:40.067 --> 00:02:41.734
carrying papers
into the White House

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.367
days before Trump left office

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.634
that said something about
declaring martial law.

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:47.100
At CPAC over the weekend,

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.067
a reporter tried to ask him
where he got those papers from,

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:51.534
and much like
Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.133
he admitted
he didn't actually know

00:02:53.133 --> 00:02:54.367
what the hell
he was talking about.

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:56.367
-That picture will go down
in history.

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.133
I'm helping save this country.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.200
-Who gave you the papers?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.033
-Who gave me the papers?
That's none of your business.

00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:03.834
A bunch of lawyers did.
I've never read them --

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:04.834
-John Eastman?
-Hold it.

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:06.400
I've never read them.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.200
I went in there with evidence
on January 15th.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.601
You guys are old news.
You're regurgitating old news.

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:14.834
January 15th, I went in there
with four papers

00:03:14.834 --> 00:03:18.400
that shows Dominion and the
election crime of the machines

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.767
and China attacking
our country --

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.834
cyberattack -- all 50 states,

00:03:22.834 --> 00:03:25.367
over 12 million votes
that Donald Trump won

00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:28.334
by 82 million to 68 million,
was the real count.

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.801
-But who gave you the papers
that advocated martial law?

00:03:30.801 --> 00:03:33.501
-A whole bunch of lawyers did.
I've never read them.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:35.000
-Alright.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.167
First of all, who would buy
a pillow from a man

00:03:37.167 --> 00:03:40.501
who has so obviously
never slept?

00:03:40.501 --> 00:03:42.267
Secondly, if you're going to
make legal claims,

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:45.234
I feel like you should use
slightly more precise language

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:47.133
than the phrase
"a whole bunch of lawyers,"

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:49.467
especially since
the correct term

00:03:49.467 --> 00:03:51.200
for a group of lawyers
is a hernia.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:54.734
Pack of wolves, pride of lions,
hernia of lawyers.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.367
Everyone knows that.

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:57.901
Also, let me see
if I follow this story.

00:03:57.901 --> 00:04:00.501
A whole bunch of lawyers
just handed you some papers

00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:03.100
about overturning the election
and declaring martial law.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.400
And you brought them
to the White House

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.567
and showed them to the president
without reading them.

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:07.801
[ As Lindell ] Mr. President,

00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:10.067
here's a whole pile of papers
I haven't read,

00:04:10.067 --> 00:04:11.834
and they're out of order
because I dropped them

00:04:11.834 --> 00:04:13.067
a few times on my way.

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:15.701
I also spilled a full cup
of coffee on every page,

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:16.901
but they're totally real.

00:04:16.901 --> 00:04:18.968
I got them from a bunch
of legal-type people

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:20.467
who told me
they're basically lawyers,

00:04:20.467 --> 00:04:25.300
except they haven't passed
da bar.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.167
[ High-pitched voice ]
I'm so sorry.

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:30.901
[ Normal voice ]
The interview, believe it
or not, got crazier from there,

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:33.934
because Lindell then whipped up
a crowd of bystanders

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:36.901
into chanting the word "traitor"
at the reporter,

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:39.033
and by crowd,
I mean like two guys.

00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:40.868
-Traitor, traitor, traitor!

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:43.067
Traitor, traitor! CBS.

00:04:43.067 --> 00:04:44.934
Robert Costa is a traitor
to the United States of America.

00:04:44.934 --> 00:04:46.968
-I'm not.
I'm trying to --

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:48.133
-No, you're a traitor.

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:50.167
This is old news
you regurgitate.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:51.868
You care about --
Why do you protect

00:04:51.868 --> 00:04:53.334
a company called Dominion

00:04:53.334 --> 00:04:55.434
and you attack a company
called MyPillow?

00:04:55.434 --> 00:04:57.000
You're a traitor to our country.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.067
You're disgusting.

00:04:58.067 --> 00:05:02.267
Traitor, traitor,
traitor, traitor!

00:05:02.267 --> 00:05:05.834
-Alright, first of all,
I didn't notice until that time

00:05:05.834 --> 00:05:08.701
he looks at his name tag
before he calls him a traitor.

00:05:08.701 --> 00:05:11.367
[ As Lindell ]
You're a traitor...Robert Costa.

00:05:13.534 --> 00:05:15.501
[ Normal voice ] Also,
you made it really easy

00:05:15.501 --> 00:05:17.634
to attack MyPillow
when you named it MyPillow.

00:05:17.634 --> 00:05:18.901
It's just a mistake

00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:21.033
to put a possessive adjective
in a product name,

00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:22.767
because as soon
as someone buys it,

00:05:22.767 --> 00:05:24.167
it technically becomes
their pillow.

00:05:24.167 --> 00:05:26.067
I feel like this
is a conversation

00:05:26.067 --> 00:05:27.968
you're not yet willing
or even capable of having,

00:05:27.968 --> 00:05:29.901
but when things calm down,
I'd love to loop back.

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:33.267
Second, I'm not sure I've ever
heard a less impressive chant.

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.234
It's like when two drunk guys
at a baseball game

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:38.601
try to get the wave going
and no one else is on board.

00:05:38.601 --> 00:05:40.701
My favorite version is when
someone at Fenway Park

00:05:40.701 --> 00:05:42.467
gets hammered
and then has muscle memory

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:45.133
to a previous game
when they did the wave.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.434
[ Boston accent ] Hey, kid,
why don't you wave yourself

00:05:54.434 --> 00:05:55.434
to the [bleep] parking lot?

00:05:55.434 --> 00:05:56.801
You're done, kid.

00:05:56.801 --> 00:05:58.901
[ Normal voice ] Imagine having
these fully insane people

00:05:58.901 --> 00:06:00.868
anywhere near the levers
of power right now

00:06:00.868 --> 00:06:02.234
as Russia threatens to escalate

00:06:02.234 --> 00:06:04.701
its already brutal and horrific
invasion of Ukraine.

00:06:04.701 --> 00:06:06.834
In response to a series
of punishing sanctions

00:06:06.834 --> 00:06:08.968
from the West,
Russian president Vladimir Putin

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.467
terrified the entire world

00:06:10.467 --> 00:06:13.033
by putting his nuclear forces
on high alert over the weekend.

00:06:13.033 --> 00:06:15.033
-Vladimir Putin
is not backing down

00:06:15.033 --> 00:06:17.267
and is escalating tensions
with the West.

00:06:17.267 --> 00:06:21.033
He ordered Russian nuclear
forces be placed on high alert,

00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:24.067
citing sanctions and aggressive
statements by NATO.

00:06:24.067 --> 00:06:26.334
It raises fears
the conflict could spiral

00:06:26.334 --> 00:06:27.934
into a nuclear attack.

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:30.501
-Okay, look, I know we all hear
the words "nuclear attack"

00:06:30.501 --> 00:06:32.968
and freak out, but I'm sure
everything's going to be fine.

00:06:32.968 --> 00:06:35.234
Do I know how?
-No, I don't know how.

00:06:35.234 --> 00:06:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.968 --> 00:06:39.167
Still...

00:06:40.968 --> 00:06:44.167
It's important to just stay calm
and follow responsible sources

00:06:44.167 --> 00:06:45.434
who aren't making
outrageous claims

00:06:45.434 --> 00:06:46.601
or doing outrageous things.

00:06:46.601 --> 00:06:48.367
Like, for example,
yesterday I very calmly

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:49.667
called up the president of NBC

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:52.000
and asked them if 30 Rock
has a bunker, and they said,

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.834
"You can have a spot
in the bunker or a fire pole,"

00:06:53.834 --> 00:06:56.367
and I yelled, "Fire pole!"
really fast, which I now regret.

00:06:56.367 --> 00:06:58.767
Still, it's going to be kickass
when I have to evacuate.

00:06:58.767 --> 00:07:01.200
Then I circled back and I said,
"A spot in the bunker?

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.667
So one exists?"
And they said, "Yes.

00:07:02.667 --> 00:07:04.834
But there's only room
for essential late-night staff,

00:07:04.834 --> 00:07:07.000
like Lorne, Jimmy Fallon,
and Wally."

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.767
-Yeah, sorry, Seth.
It's true.

00:07:08.767 --> 00:07:09.934
They want me in the bunker.

00:07:09.934 --> 00:07:11.300
-But why?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.701
-Seth, I do cue cards for "SNL."

00:07:13.701 --> 00:07:15.133
Plus, they said
if you get nuked,

00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:16.300
I can do a show from the bunker

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.534
called "Late Night
with the Cue Card Guy."

00:07:18.534 --> 00:07:20.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.133
I know.

00:07:28.334 --> 00:07:30.734
This has been "A Cue-ser Look."

00:07:32.701 --> 00:07:35.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:36.934 --> 00:07:38.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.901 --> 00:07:45.400
-Pretty robust applause there,
everybody.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.968 --> 00:07:52.400
Also, who said it was okay to
make him the graphics package?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:55.367
The point is,
lest you, for even a moment,

00:07:55.367 --> 00:07:58.133
thought that interlude
with Wally was the point,

00:07:58.133 --> 00:07:59.801
the point is,
Putin is lashing out

00:07:59.801 --> 00:08:01.467
and threatening the unthinkable
in response

00:08:01.467 --> 00:08:02.868
to a series of intense sanctions

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:04.167
and other punishments
from the West.

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:06.033
And even his closest
military officials

00:08:06.033 --> 00:08:09.033
seem incredibly uncomfortable
taking these orders from him.

00:08:09.033 --> 00:08:10.667
-We've seen very clearly
this week

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:12.434
that Putin is isolated
from his own officials.

00:08:12.434 --> 00:08:15.601
We're talking about the order
for the nuclear alert.

00:08:15.601 --> 00:08:18.467
When he gave this order
yesterday in the Kremlin,

00:08:18.467 --> 00:08:23.033
he was sitting with his two
top military officials,

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:26.100
the defense minister and
the chief of the general staff.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.000
And they weren't allowed
to get within 15 feet of them.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.334
They were sat at the other end

00:08:30.334 --> 00:08:33.701
of one of these
comically huge tables

00:08:33.701 --> 00:08:36.200
that Putin makes people
sit at in the Kremlin.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.100
The way that he summons
these officials

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.033
sitting at these huge distances
from him

00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:43.701
around these ludicrous tables,

00:08:43.701 --> 00:08:46.267
a lot of them look
visibly uncomfortable.

00:08:46.267 --> 00:08:48.767
-Okay, first of all,
look at this table.

00:08:48.767 --> 00:08:50.601
[ Laughter ]

00:08:52.701 --> 00:08:54.033
That table is insane.

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.767
Dude, if you're worried
about COVID,

00:08:55.767 --> 00:08:58.968
I have terrible news
about nuclear fallout.

00:08:58.968 --> 00:08:59.968
[ Russian accent ]
Mr. President,

00:08:59.968 --> 00:09:01.534
first warhead has exploded.

00:09:01.534 --> 00:09:04.501
[ As Putin ]
Give me mask -- N96.

00:09:04.501 --> 00:09:06.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:06.234 --> 00:09:09.100
Is better by one.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:10.234
So get joke.

00:09:10.234 --> 00:09:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.234 --> 00:09:14.300
[ Normal voice ]
Also, look at the faces

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:15.801
of his two top
military officials

00:09:15.801 --> 00:09:18.033
as he was giving them
the nuclear order this weekend.

00:09:18.033 --> 00:09:19.501
They look like
they just turned the key

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:21.934
to start the nuclear countdown,
but instead it opened a door

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:24.601
to a room where their parents
were having an orgy.

00:09:24.601 --> 00:09:26.067
[ Russian accent ]
Sergei, look away.

00:09:26.067 --> 00:09:28.667
[ Normal voice ] The point is,
no one, not even, apparently,

00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:31.634
Putin's own officials,
is watching this horrific war

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:34.534
and the humanitarian catastrophe
that is unfolding right now

00:09:34.534 --> 00:09:36.901
and thinking, "Gee,
this Putin guy is a genius."

00:09:36.901 --> 00:09:39.834
Wait, hold on.
Oh, damn it, I forgot.

00:09:39.834 --> 00:09:41.567
I forgot there was
a Trump clip coming.

00:09:41.567 --> 00:09:42.667
What's that?

00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:45.033
There's always a Trump coming?

00:09:45.033 --> 00:09:46.234
But are we sure that's fair?

00:09:46.234 --> 00:09:47.667
I mean, he's a former president

00:09:47.667 --> 00:09:50.400
just trying to enjoy
a quiet retirement.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.000
Yeah, like, why don't we
just leave him alone?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.434
What's that?
Oh, the clip is from his speech

00:09:54.434 --> 00:09:56.033
at the Conservative
Political Action Conference,

00:09:56.033 --> 00:09:58.234
where he gave the strongest
hints yet he might run again?

00:09:58.234 --> 00:09:59.367
And in that same speech,

00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:00.567
he doubled down
on his praise of Putin?

00:10:00.567 --> 00:10:03.167
Alright, well, then roll
the clip [bleep]

00:10:03.167 --> 00:10:04.701
-Yesterday, reporters asked me

00:10:04.701 --> 00:10:08.133
if I thought
President Putin was smart.

00:10:08.133 --> 00:10:11.200
I said, "Of course, he's smart,"
to which I was greeted with,

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.501
"Oh, that's such
a terrible thing to say."

00:10:14.501 --> 00:10:17.734
I like to tell the tru--
Yes, he's smart.

00:10:17.734 --> 00:10:21.000
The NATO nations
and indeed the world,

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:26.334
as he looks over
what's happening strategically

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:29.801
with no repercussions
or threats whatsoever,

00:10:29.801 --> 00:10:32.334
they're not so smart.

00:10:32.334 --> 00:10:34.868
They're looking
the opposite of smart.

00:10:34.868 --> 00:10:37.334
"If you take over Ukraine,

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:39.901
we're going to sanction you,"
they say.

00:10:39.901 --> 00:10:41.167
"Sanction?"

00:10:41.167 --> 00:10:44.033
Well, that's a pretty weak
statement.

00:10:44.033 --> 00:10:46.200
Putin is saying, "Oh,
they're going to sanction me?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.334
They've sanctioned me
for the last 25 years.

00:10:48.334 --> 00:10:50.234
You mean I can take over
a whole country

00:10:50.234 --> 00:10:52.033
and they're
going to sanction me?

00:10:52.033 --> 00:10:54.133
You mean they're not going to
blow us to pieces,

00:10:54.133 --> 00:10:58.300
at least psychologically?"

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:02.000
-Nothing is funnier than
a person saying you're not smart

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.033
and then the best way
they can come up

00:11:04.033 --> 00:11:05.934
to describe
the opposite of smart

00:11:05.934 --> 00:11:08.334
are the words
"opposite of smart."

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:09.934
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.934 --> 00:11:11.367
Also, what the hell
are you talking about,

00:11:11.367 --> 00:11:13.400
blow Putin to pieces
psychologically?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.601
What do you want us to do?

00:11:14.601 --> 00:11:16.467
Get him high
and play "Dark Side of the Moon"

00:11:16.467 --> 00:11:18.267
synced up to "The Wizard of Oz"?

00:11:18.267 --> 00:11:21.367
"Whoa, this [bleep] blowing me
to pieces psychologically.

00:11:21.367 --> 00:11:23.868
Vasily, how about you?
You super high?"

00:11:23.868 --> 00:11:26.567
[ Russian accent ] Well, man,
I cannot feel toes right now.

00:11:26.567 --> 00:11:27.868
[ Normal voice ] And, yeah,

00:11:27.868 --> 00:11:32.033
all my Russian accents
are going to sound the same.

00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:34.834
But just remember, the better
my Russian accents get,

00:11:34.834 --> 00:11:36.667
the worse things are going.

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:38.033
In fact,
if you ever watch this show

00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:39.300
and find yourself saying,

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.200
"Seth's Russian accent's
getting better and better,"

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.901
that's when you need
to head to the bunker

00:11:42.901 --> 00:11:46.567
or, if you're in 30 Rock,
the fire pole.

00:11:46.567 --> 00:11:49.467
Fire pole's going to be
a huge hit, guys.

00:11:49.467 --> 00:11:52.000
The world is aghast
at Russia's brutal

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.667
and horrific invasion of Ukraine
and its threats of escalation,

00:11:54.667 --> 00:11:57.067
including the thousands
of ordinary Russians

00:11:57.067 --> 00:11:59.334
who've taken to the streets and
been arrested for protesting.

00:11:59.334 --> 00:12:01.033
What we need now,
more than anything,

00:12:01.033 --> 00:12:03.701
is to ignore the deranged rants
of reckless morons like Trump

00:12:03.701 --> 00:12:05.534
and do everything possible
to help the refugees,

00:12:05.534 --> 00:12:06.834
support the Ukrainian people,

00:12:06.834 --> 00:12:09.501
and find a peaceful path
toward de-escalation.

00:12:09.501 --> 00:12:12.200
Send whoever you need to send --
diplomats, ambassadors,

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.534
or, hell, maybe even...
-A whole bunch of lawyers.

00:12:14.534 --> 00:12:16.834
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:20.434 --> 00:12:22.000
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.234
over 2 million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:12:24.234 --> 00:12:26.734
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses,

00:12:26.734 --> 00:12:28.534
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:12:28.534 --> 00:12:30.634
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:12:30.634 --> 00:12:33.300
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

